  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banco Continental S.A.E.C.A.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project consists of a loan to Banco Continental. The purpose of this project is to provide financing to small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) in Paraguay by granting medium- and long-term loans for their modernization and/or expansion, according to eligibility criteria to be set by the IIC.		Founded in 1980, Banco Continental is the second leading full-service bank in Paraguay&#x2019;s financial system in terms of total assets. Focused primarily on SMEs and corporate lending, its traditional target market has been companies in the agricultural sector. Banco Continental serves more than 100,000 clients through its 53 branch offices, 125 automatic teller machines, and website for online transactions.</narrative>
  </description>
